+ * worktree", and a later direct merge has no hook to record it. A READ path cannot undo the missed
+ * merge, but it can repair the wiring before the next ordinary Git operation. This function is
+ * idempotent: an existing matching installation is reused instead of rewriting live hooks.
+ */
